  "configuration_id": "config_037",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile setups with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and resnet50 image encoder (config_031) achieve high validation accuracy (0.6776). This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l (a more powerful image encoder) while keeping RNA encoder, aggregation (avgpool), and fusion (weighted) consistent. This isolates the effect of the image encoder, which is critical for improving performance. It balances exploitation (building on config_031's success) and exploration (testing a stronger encoder)."
}

